{"_meta":{"securitySchemes":[{"scopes":["looks:write"],"type":"oauth2"}]},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Update my look"},"description":"Change a saved look. Only the fields you send change; list fields (steps, products, tags, categories, occasions) replace the stored list whole. Look photos are kept. Steps can't be changed while any step has a photoUrl; the user edits those steps in the BeautySpark app. When the look's steps link products or shades, send productRefs and shadeRefs on every step you send ([] for a step with none): a step sent without them is refused unless products is sent too. To unlink every step, send products too.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","properties":{"categorySlugs":{"description":"Categories: preset slugs (everyday, work, date_night, evening, party, festival, wedding_guest, bridal, prom, holiday, vacation, photoshoot, editorial, no_makeup, smokey, glam, natural_glow, bold_color) or the names of the user's own categories. Replaces the whole stored list, so send the complete list.","items":{"maxLength":40,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"maxItems":10,"type":"array"},"difficultyLevel":{"description":"How hard the look is to do.","enum":["easy","medium","advanced"],"type":"string"},"estimatedTotalTime":{"description":"Time for the whole look, in minutes.","maximum":1440,"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"id":{"description":"A saved look id from search_my_looks.","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$","type":"string"},"inspirationUrl":{"anyOf":[{"maxLength":2048,"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"An http(s) link to what inspired the look, kept as text. Never fetched. Send null to clear it."},"intensityLevel":{"description":"How strong the whole look is.","enum":["very_subtle","light","medium","bold","dramatic"],"type":"string"},"isFavourite":{"description":"Mark the look as a favourite.","type":"boolean"},"notes":{"anyOf":[{"maxLength":4000,"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Free-text notes about the look. Send null to clear it."},"occasions":{"description":"Free-text occasions, e.g. [\"office\", \"wedding guest\"]. Replaces the whole stored list, so send the complete list.","items":{"maxLength":60,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"maxItems":10,"type":"array"},"personName":{"anyOf":[{"maxLength":50,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Name of one of the user's persons in BeautySpark (exact name, any case). Leave it out unless the user names someone. Send null to clear it."},"products":{"description":"Products used. Each: name (required); productType, e.g. \"eyeshadow palette\"; area; userPaletteId = the paletteId from list_my_palettes when it is a palette the user owns; shades = the pans used, each with name, hexColor (#RRGGBB) and position in the palette. Replaces the whole stored list, so send the complete list. Send steps too, so their productRefs stay correct.","items":{"properties":{"area":{"maxLength":60,"type":"string"},"name":{"maxLength":120,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"productType":{"maxLength":60,"type":"string"},"shades":{"default":[],"items":{"properties":{"hexColor":{"pattern":"^#(?:[0-9a-fA-F]{3}|[0-9a-fA-F]{6})$","type":"string"},"name":{"maxLength":120,"type":"string"},"position":{"maxLength":60,"type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"maxItems":24,"type":"array"},"userPaletteId":{"format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$","type":"string"}},"required":["name"],"type":"object"},"maxItems":20,"type":"array"},"steps":{"description":"Ordered steps, first to last. Each step: instruction (required); title; area; positions = where on the eye, only 